# A Firebase console export (Realtime Database -> Data -> ... -> Export JSON) holds members' emails, phone numbers
# and the chat. It never belongs in git. The console saves one as <project>-default-rtdb-export.json and the
# tests/emulator README's example is camp-export.json; the patterns below cover both, and any other name with
# "export" in it. Keep exports outside the repo anyway (tests/emulator/README.md, "Export replay").
*-export.json
*.export.json
*export*.json
exports/
